%% Protocol Buffers Data Flow
%% Commit: ea940efd2c20e4e8b6509153a703175a51e66749

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Code
    participant Msg as Message Object
    participant Ser as Serializer
    participant Wire as Wire Format
    participant Net as Network/Storage
    participant Par as Parser
    participant Msg2 as Message Object

    Note over User,Msg2: Serialization Flow

    User->>Msg: Create Message
    User->>Msg: Set Fields
    User->>Ser: SerializeToString()

    Ser->>Msg: ByteSizeLong()
    Msg-->>Ser: Calculate size
    Ser->>Ser: Allocate buffer

    loop For each field
        Ser->>Msg: Get field value
        Ser->>Wire: Encode tag + value
        Wire-->>Ser: Encoded bytes
    end

    Ser-->>User: Serialized bytes
    User->>Net: Send/Store

    Note over User,Msg2: Deserialization Flow

    Net-->>User: Receive bytes
    User->>Par: ParseFromString()

    loop While bytes remain
        Par->>Wire: Read tag
        Wire-->>Par: Field number + type
        Par->>Wire: Read value
        Wire-->>Par: Decoded value
        Par->>Msg2: Set field
    end

    Par-->>User: Success/Failure
    User->>Msg2: Access fields
